-WORKER B CLAIM: PASS
-TOKEN ROTATION: PASS
-STALE WORKER REJECTED: PASS
-WORKER B OWNERSHIP PRESERVED: PASS
-NEW WORKER SUCCESS: PASS
-OWNERSHIP CLEARED: PASS
-```
-
-### Command
-
-``` bash
-python -m tests.manual_processing_token_test
-```
