-repositories/
-    └── database access
-
-models/
-    └── persistence/domain representation
-
-database/
-    └── connection/session
-
-scraper/
-    └── external website/browser interaction
-
-tasks/
-    └── background job orchestration
-
-celery_app/
-    └── Celery configuration
-```
-
-Dengan demikian test hanya memanggil public interface dari layer yang
-sedang diuji.
